<title>NEW ZEALAND: Tenz fund to have div reinvestment option.</title>
<headline>Tenz fund to have div reinvestment option.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The TeNZ fund is to have a dividend reinvestment option, fund operator the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The option will be available to TeNZ holders at the next TeNZ distribution in March 1997.</p>
<p>The terms of the scheme will be included in the next prospectus for TeNZ, due to be issued before November 10, 1996.</p>
<p>NZSE chairman David Wale said that initially TeNZ thought it would be too complex, but the exchange had come up with a solution that would be efficient, flexible and cheap.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
